  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (RNA-only, singleprofile) achieves 0.4849 validation accuracy. This experiment tests whether using multiprofile with average pooling aggregation (while keeping RNA encoder and image encoder unchanged) improves performance. It isolates the effect of profile setting and aggregation, which are critical design choices. Since multiprofile could leverage more data and aggregation might enhance feature representation, this comparison clarifies their individual impact under the same RNA encoder, avoiding unnecessary complexity."
